{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1339,
    "dDurationMs": 4461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The setup for the twins paradox is as follows\n– suppose I sit on earth while you head"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5800,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off on a rocketship at a constant speed for\na while, then turn around and come back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10000,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We know that moving things experience time\nmore slowly, so I'll think that when you get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14540,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back, you should be younger than me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16420,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But from your perspective, the earth (with\nme on it) is doing the moving, receding and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20400,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then returning, so you think that I should\nbe younger than you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23940,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who's right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24940,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll use the fact that time rotates to sort\nthis all out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27810,
    "dDurationMs": 4449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok, so from my perspective, every second that\npasses I stay in the same place, while every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32259,
    "dDurationMs": 3361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "second that passes, you get farther away,\nand then closer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35620,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simple enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36660,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From my perspective, you'll take ten seconds\nto get back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39540,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since you're moving, I'll think that time\nis passing more slowly for you, so I'll calculate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43930,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that your journey, for you, takes eight seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46730,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now – and this is the important bit – since\nyou're moving, what you think of as the forward"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50960,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "direction of time will be rotated relative\nto _my_ perception of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54800,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on your outward journey, the seconds will\ntick away like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58360,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on your return journey, the seconds will\nlook like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61680,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From your perspective, your journey does indeed\ntake eight seconds!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65080,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But almost immediately, we also see the solution\nto the twins paradox: right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69880,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This bit of my time is unaccounted for by\nyou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73140,
    "dDurationMs": 4069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During your entire journey, you'll think that\ntime is passing more slowly for me than for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77209,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you (and indeed it is – here, and here,\nadd up to only 6.4 seconds), but because of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82429,
    "dDurationMs": 4201,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your change in velocity when you turn around\nto come home, your notion of time rotates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86630,
    "dDurationMs": 2969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and skips right over a large swath of my time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89599,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which amounts to precisely – you guessed\nit – the missing 3.6 seconds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94259,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is the resolution to the twins paradox:\nbecause you changed velocity, your notion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99209,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of simultaneous times rotates, so your accounting\nof how time passes in parts of the universe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103890,
    "dDurationMs": 2829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far away from you will have gaps in it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106719,
    "dDurationMs": 3910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, in reality it wouldn't have gaps, because\nyou couldn't instantaneously change direction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110629,
    "dDurationMs": 3431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "– you'd have to fire your rockets to start\nheading home, and during that acceleration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114060,
    "dDurationMs": 4439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your notion of time would have very very quickly\nrotated through the missing gap in my journey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118499,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowing you to properly account for the missing\ntime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120909,
    "dDurationMs": 5041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In summary: during your outward and return\njourneys, ten seconds would pass for me, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125950,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd calculate eight seconds as passing for\nyou."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128349,
    "dDurationMs": 4970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eight seconds _would_ pass for you, and you'd\ncalculate 6.4 seconds as passing for me during"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133319,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your outward and return journeys, and 3.6\nseconds as passing for me during your acceleration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137959,
    "dDurationMs": 2491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(even if it was basically instantaneous)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140450,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we both agree that when you come home,\nyou'll be younger!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143310,
    "dDurationMs": 4989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And indeed, this is what happens when you\nsend an atomic clock flying around in in an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148299,
    "dDurationMs": 4011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "airplane: it records less time as having passed\nthan a twin atomic clock that stays on the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152310,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153410,
    "dDurationMs": 6409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PS the time rotations I've been talking about\nare actually called \"Lorentz Transformations\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159819,
    "dDurationMs": 3691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're the way that most working physicists\nthink about special relativity and things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163510,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like time dilation, relativistic doppler shifts,\nand so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166750,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trying to understand relativity just by using\nbasic equations for time dilation and length"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171010,
    "dDurationMs": 3979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "contraction (like is often done in beginning\nphysics classes) will often lead to confusing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174989,
    "dDurationMs": 14551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "apparent contradictions, because they don't\ntake into account the full changing of simultaneity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189540,
    "dDurationMs": 23059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of events, and \nso on."
    } ]
  } ]
}
